│   - Payments, transfers, account changes, card freezes, and similar actions require confirmation.       │
│   - Additional step-up verification, such as OTP, may be used for sensitive operations.                 │
│                                                                                                         │
│ - Separation of data and instructions                                                                   │
│   - Internal customer records, prompts, and operational metadata are not exposed as user-controllable   │
