│ - First, bring any **high-utilization cards** down to safer levels                                      │
│ - Then resume strict **highest-APR-first** repayment                                                    │
│ - Continue using one or two cards lightly and paying in full monthly to show active, responsible use    │
│                                                                                                         │
│ ### 6. Avoid adding new debt during payoff                                                              │
│ While reducing balances:                                                                                │
│ - Limit new credit applications                                                                         │
│ - Avoid financing discretionary purchases                                                               │
│ - Pause large nonessential spending if possible                                                         │
│ - Do not rely on balance growth to manage cash flow                                                     │
│                                                                                                         │
│ This keeps your debt reduction plan from stalling.                                                      │
│                                                                                                         │
│ ### 7. Use cash flow strategically                                                                      │
│ Based on your available balances, you appear to have capacity to accelerate debt reduction without      │
│ stressing liquidity. A prudent framework would be:                                                      │
│ - Keep an emergency reserve intact                                                                      │
│ - Maintain enough checking for monthly obligations                                                      │
│ - Use surplus cash to attack the most expensive debt                                                    │
│                                                                                                         │
│ A good rule is to avoid using all liquid funds at once; preserve flexibility for unexpected expenses.   │
│                                                                                                         │
│ ### 8. Consider refinancing or consolidation selectively                                                │
│ This can help if:                                                                                       │
│ - You qualify for a materially lower APR                                                                │
│ - Fees do not offset the savings                                                                        │
│ - The new structure supports faster payoff rather than extending debt unnecessarily                     │
│                                                                                                         │
│ Good candidates:                                                                                        │
│ - High-rate personal loans                                                                              │
│ - Multiple card balances that could move to a lower-rate product                                        │
│                                                                                                         │
│ Be cautious with:                                                                                       │
│ - Long repayment terms that reduce monthly payment but increase total interest                          │
│ - Consolidation that frees up cards only to have balances rebuilt                                       │
│                                                                                                         │
│ ### 9. Monitor your credit mix and account activity                                                     │
│ To maintain healthy credit while paying debt down:                                                      │
